/**
 * Authentic GitHub REST API v3 (X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2022-11-28) Payload Fixtures.
 * Grounded strictly in the official GitHub REST API OpenAPI schema:
 * - GET /repos/{owner}/{repo} (Full Repository schema)
 * - GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues (Issue schema with User, Label, Milestone, Reactions)
 * - GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls (Pull Request Simple schema with embedded head.repo and base.repo)
 * - GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/actions/runs (Workflow Run schema with actor, triggering_actor, repository)
 * - GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/contents/{path} (Content File schema with base64 content and _links)
 */

